---
title: "Stack"
description: "Spaces its children evenly in a vertical column."
tags: [layout, css]
usage: |
  Add the `stack` class to a container. It uses `gap`, so the spacing is the same
  between every child regardless of their margins.
customProperties:
  "--stack-space": "Gap between children."
---

<link rel="stylesheet" href="./styles.css" media="screen">

<div class="stack" style="--stack-space: 1rem">
  <div>First</div>
  <div>Second</div>
  <div>Third</div>
</div>
